Scope

The MIT grant above applies to this repository.

The CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 content of the tavern workflow lives in the
GitHub-only tavern content repo (github.com/ai4rpg/tavern-content): the
three skill bodies and the persona prose in its preset package
(`@ai4rpg/dsh-tavern-preset`), the four named-subagent personas in
`@ai4rpg/tavern-agents`. This repository is MIT code only.
